<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 603.63, up 1.57.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 281 to 232.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 16,455,140 compared with 19,270,710 on Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
